#: src/features.md:280
msgid ""
"Enables (de)serialization of `Py<T>` objects via [serde](https://serde.rs/). "
"This allows to use [`#[derive(Serialize, Deserialize)`](https://serde.rs/"
"derive.html) on structs that hold references to `#[pyclass]` instances"
msgstr ""

